		position: absolute;
		right: -1%;
		bottom: 11%;
		width: 0.66rem;
		aspect-ratio: 0.82;
		border-radius: 55% 45% 62% 38%;
		background: rgb(43 16 6 / 72%);
		box-shadow:
			-1.1rem 0.7rem 0 -0.08rem rgb(43 16 6 / 56%),
			0.5rem 1.1rem 0 0.02rem rgb(43 16 6 / 62%),
			-2.1rem -0.35rem 0 -0.12rem rgb(43 16 6 / 48%),
			1.25rem -0.95rem 0 0.12rem rgb(43 16 6 / 58%),
			-2.8rem 1.5rem 0 -0.07rem rgb(43 16 6 / 46%),
			1.15rem 2rem 0 0.08rem rgb(43 16 6 / 54%),
			-1.6rem -1.7rem 0 -0.15rem rgb(43 16 6 / 42%),
			2rem 0.45rem 0 -0.12rem rgb(43 16 6 / 50%),
			-3.4rem 0.15rem 0 0.06rem rgb(43 16 6 / 44%),
			2.5rem -1.4rem 0 -0.05rem rgb(43 16 6 / 48%),
			-0.4rem 2.7rem 0 0.14rem rgb(43 16 6 / 52%),
			1.9rem 2.4rem 0 -0.1rem rgb(43 16 6 / 46%);
